# Raw image binaries in dataset trees
datasets/**/*.jpg
datasets/**/*.jpeg
datasets/**/*.png
datasets/**/*.bmp
datasets/**/*.tiff
datasets/**/*.webp

# ── Dataset Whitelist Exceptions (Must Track) ─────────────────────────────────
!**/.gitkeep
!**/README.md
!**/dataset_info.md
!datasets/manifests/**
!datasets/**/metadata/**
!docs/**

